From: Angaddeep Singh <angxddeep@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Aug 2026 12:46:00 +0700
Subject: Fix ImsService emergency call crash

Since A16, `includes(String)` in PackagesTagsList has been replaced by
`containsPackage(String)`

ImsLocationHandler still uses `includes(String)`, which causes
NoSuchMethodError error from IMS when attempting to call emergency
services.

Patch ImsLocationHandler to use containsPackage(String) instead.

(cherry-picked from d0ee2dc3c4e2a0c5284a49b9d30f439f60517ee7)
Different commit message from original author
This is the revised commit message.

Change-Id: I53aeb9c8b6b58404f923d5953c486e2af01ca3b0
Co-authored-by: codex <codex@users.noreply.github.com>
Signed-off-by: archcloudy <cloudguy9@proton.me>
---
 smali/com/mediatek/wfo/impl/ImsLocationHandler.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali/com/mediatek/wfo/impl/ImsLocationHandler.smali b/smali/com/mediatek/wfo/impl/ImsLocationHandler.smali
index f960537..8650623 100644
--- a/smali/com/mediatek/wfo/impl/ImsLocationHandler.smali
+++ b/smali/com/mediatek/wfo/impl/ImsLocationHandler.smali
@@ -4522,7 +4522,7 @@
     .local v2, "whitelist":Landroid/os/PackageTagsList;
     if-eqz v2, :cond_0
 
-    invoke-virtual {v2, v1}, Landroid/os/PackageTagsList;->includes(Ljava/lang/String;)Z
+    invoke-virtual {v2, v1}, Landroid/os/PackageTagsList;->containsPackage(Ljava/lang/String;)Z
 
     move-result v3
 
